    <h2 style="color: #ffd700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 2px solid #30363d; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">Live Discussion Suite V5.0 | Manual</h2>
    <div style="line-height: 1.6; font-size: 14px;">
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Welcome to the <strong>Ultimate Broadcast Overlay</strong>. This highly customizable, real-time sports graphic suite runs entirely in your browser.</p>
      
      <h3 style="color: #4ade80; border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d; padding-bottom: 5px;">I. System Setup & Views</h3>
      <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 5px;">
        <li><strong>Control Panel (Your Screen):</strong> Open the main HTML file normally in your web browser.</li>
        <li><strong>Live Overlay (Audience Screen):</strong> In OBS/vMix, add this HTML file as a <strong>Browser Source</strong> and append <code>?view=overlay</code> to the end of the file path. The control panel will hide, leaving only transparent graphics.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="color: #4ade80; margin-top: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d; padding-bottom: 5px;">II. Dynamic Interaction & Syncing</h3>
      <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 5px;">
        <li><strong>Instant Actions:</strong> Typing in text boxes, clicking "Set Now/Next", and toggling visibility checkboxes update immediately on stream.</li>
        <li><strong>Draft Actions (Requires SYNC):</strong> Changing fonts, sizes, and colors preview locally in real-time as you drag the sliders. Click <strong>"SYNC TO STREAM"</strong> to push them live to your audience.</li>
        <li><strong>Click & Drag:</strong> You can click and drag the Vertical Agenda Panels, the Guest Nameplates, and the LSS Widget anywhere on the screen. The position automatically syncs.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="color: #4ade80; margin-top: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d; padding-bottom: 5px;">III. Features</h3>
