        <li><strong>Vertical Agenda Panel (Linked & Auto-Sorting):</strong> Build your run-of-show list here. Clicking "Set Now", "Set Next", or "Mark Done" automatically sorts the list and pushes the text directly to the top Agenda Tracker. The Live item jumps to the top, upcoming items tuck underneath, and completed items drop to the bottom with a green checkmark!</li>
        <li><strong>Custom Vertical List (Free Text):</strong> An independent list panel perfect for displaying "Team Strengths" or "Weaknesses". You can freely highlight multiple rows at the same time using a custom color picker for each row.</li>
        <li><strong>Guest Nameplates:</strong> Add unlimited guests. Drag them into position under your webcams. Each guest has completely independent styling for their name and title backgrounds.</li>
        <li><strong>Border Presets:</strong> Quickly snap professional camera borders. We've pre-loaded 10 themes, but you can create and save your own.</li>
        <li><strong>Undo/Redo/Reset:</strong> Made a mistake? Use Undo/Redo at the top. Reset wipes all unsaved changes and returns to your launch state.</li>
        <li><strong>Global Layout Presets:</strong> 6 distinct themes (Cyberpunk, Minimalist, Sunset, etc.) available in 3 sizes each (Small, Regular, Large). Loading these recolors the ENTIRE broadcast suite.</li>
